 "title": "Thom class of a vector bundle",
 "statement": "Under the hypotheses of Lemma “Gluing the Thom class” (`pur9-lem-thom-gluing`), the Thom class of $\\pi:V\\to Z$ is the morphism $\\mathrm{th}_V$ of that lemma. For $V=\\Aaf^c_B$ with its standard trivialization, $\\mathrm{th}_V=\\mathrm{th}_c$.",
